# Dance of the Dead's enters ability is Stifled, so the Aura stays attached to the Ornithopter card in Bot1's graveyard.
# "Enchanted creature" means a creature permanent on the battlefield (CR 109.2, 303.4m): the card gets no +1/+1, and with
# no enchanted creature there is no enchanted creature's controller, so the upkeep ability doesn't trigger in Bot1's
# upkeep - not even though the card's owner, Bot1, is treated as its controller off the battlefield (CR 108.4a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Cut Down
Dance of the Dead
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Stifle
Island x10

